cff-version: 1.2.0
title: mas-sentry-toolkit
message: >-
  If you reference this toolkit, please cite it using the metadata
  below.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Kiryak
    given-names: Evgeny
    orcid: 'https://orcid.org/0009-0001-9871-2924'
    affiliation: MASec Lab
repository-code: 'https://github.com/evkir/mas-sentry-toolkit'
url: 'https://maseclab.com/products/'
abstract: >-
  An offensive and audit toolkit for multi-agent systems. Audits
  deployments over MCP, A2A, MQTT and AMQP; implements ABFP
  behavioural fingerprinting for detecting agent impersonation,
  hijacking and drift, and an MCP offensive audit module covering
  tool poisoning, SSRF and path traversal. Emits SARIF 2.1.0 with
  findings mapped to the OWASP Top 10 for Agentic Applications.
keywords:
  - multi-agent systems
  - agentic AI
  - LLM security
  - MCP
  - A2A
  - MQTT
  - OWASP
  - SARIF
